{% extends "eng/_layout.txt.j2" %}
{#- RESOLUTION_BELOW_FLOOR - quality gate: effective resolution below the readability floor -#}
{% block subject %}The pages you sent are too small to read{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The pages reached us at a resolution too low for the writing to be read
reliably. Letters run into one another, and the digits of an account number
or an amount cannot be told apart.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please rescan the document at {{ recommended_dpi }} DPI and send it again.
If you are photographing the page instead, hold the camera so that the page
fills the whole frame, and take the picture in good light.{% endblock %}
